<section class="hero image-hero" style="background-image:url('https://expedition-growth-lab.brian-mcrae.chatgpt.site/assets/one-rising-sun-hero.png')"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">The Corporate Partnership Program</div><h1 class="ors-serif" style="font-size:clamp(78px,9vw,128px);line-height:.9;margin:0">One Rising<br>Sun.</h1><p class="hero-copy" style="font-size:20px">A values-aligned partnership program for builders, brands, suppliers, creators, and community leaders working to make the overland world stronger—not merely louder.</p><a class="button gold" href="/contact" style="margin-top:24px">Begin the Conversation</a></div></section>
<section class="section cream"><div class="wrap section-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow orange">Why it exists</div><h2 class="section-title">Different roles.<br>One responsibility to the trail.</h2></div><div class="copy">No company builds alone. Products move through suppliers, fabricators, dealers, creators, events, clubs, customers, public lands, and local communities.<br>One Rising Sun exists to build relationships across that ecosystem without reducing partnership to logo placement, referral math, or ceremonial handshakes beside a folding table.</div></div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap"><div class="role-grid"><article class="role"><div class="num">01</div><h3 style="text-transform:none">Utility</h3><p>The relationship must create something genuinely useful.</p></article><article class="role"><div class="num">02</div><h3 style="text-transform:none">Trust</h3><p>We say what we mean, keep our word, and protect the people whose work makes the partnership possible.</p></article><article class="role"><div class="num">03</div><h3 style="text-transform:none">Independence</h3><p>Growth should strengthen good companies without sanding away their identity or handing away their future.</p></article><article class="role"><div class="num">04</div><h3 style="text-transform:none">Community</h3><p>Success should strengthen founders, employees, customers, communities, and the trail itself.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section cream"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:800px"><div class="eyebrow gray">Partnership Paths</div><h2 class="section-title">Built around shared work.</h2><p class="copy">Relationships may include builder support, systems collaboration, field infrastructure, referrals, co-created intelligence, event programs, research, education, community service, or other work that becomes valuable because the right people chose to build it together.<br>The shape follows the opportunity. The standards do not bend to fit the opportunity.</p><a class="button" href="/contact" style="margin-top:24px">Bring Us the Possibility</a></div></section>
